# Toy castle gate bay (ticket 27.7): a toy_castle_wall_bay (5.2 m long, walk at 5 m) with the gate cut through it, a passage 3 m wide under a round arch 3.5 m
# high, framed on both faces by a mint arch block (a ring of arch blocks and two posts). The gate tower stands on the walk: two cream slabs either side of
# a 1.7 m wide walkway (2.3 m clear under the beech block that bridges it, so the wall-walk runs through the tower), the beech block to 9 m, a lilac lid and four small
# corner blocks. The passage is cut 10 cm below y = 0, so its floor is the level's ground, not a face of its own in the ground's plane.
